{"speciesId":705,"names":{"fr":"Colimucus","es":"Sliggoo","en":"Sliggoo","ja":"ヌメイル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il repousse ses ennemis en sécrétant un fluide qui dissout tout ce qu’il touche. Suite à une dégénérescence de ses yeux, il est aveugle."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Segrega una mucosidad que corroe todo lo que toca y consigue así ahuyentar al enemigo. Sus ojos han involucionado, por lo que no puede ver."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It drives away opponents by excreting a sticky liquid that can dissolve anything. Its eyes devolved, so it can’t see anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"なんでも 溶かしてしまう 粘液を 分泌して 敵を 撃退する。 目玉は 退化して 見えていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses quatre cornes constituant un radar extrêmement puissant, il n’a besoin ni de nez ni d’oreilles pour percevoir les sons et les odeurs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus cuatro antenas constituyen un radar de gran potencia. Hacen las veces de nariz y oídos para percibir tanto ruidos como olores."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its four horns are a high-performance radar system. It uses them to sense sounds and smells, rather than using ears or a nose."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"４本の ツノは 高性能の レーダー。 耳や 鼻の かわりに 音や においを 感じ取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il repousse ses ennemis en sécrétant un fluide qui dissout tout ce qu’il touche. Suite à une dégénérescence de ses yeux, il est aveugle."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Segrega una mucosidad que corroe todo lo que toca y consigue así ahuyentar al enemigo. Sus ojos han involucionado, por lo que no puede ver."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It drives away opponents by excreting a sticky liquid that can dissolve anything. Its eyes devolved, so it can’t see anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"なんでも 溶かしてしまう 粘液を 分泌して 敵を 撃退する。 目玉は 退化して 見えていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses quatre cornes constituant un radar extrêmement puissant, il n’a besoin ni de nez ni d’oreilles pour percevoir les sons et les odeurs."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus cuatro antenas constituyen un radar de gran potencia. Hacen las veces de nariz y oídos para percibir tanto ruidos como olores."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its four horns are a high-performance radar system. It uses them to sense sounds and smells, rather than using ears or a nose."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"４本の ツノは 高性能の レーダー。 耳や 鼻の かわりに 音や においを 感じ取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Comme il a du mal à distinguer ses alliés de ses proies, la faim peut parfois le pousser à asperger ses amis de son solvant."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Le cuesta distinguir a sus presas de sus aliados, por eso no es raro que se coma a uno de los suyos de vez en cuando sin inmutarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has trouble drawing a line between friends and food. It will calmly try to melt and eat even those it gets along well with."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"餌と 仲間の 区別が 曖昧。 仲良くなっても 平気で 溶かして 喰らおうと してくることが ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme il n’a pas de dent, il sécrète un solvant dont il asperge ses proies pour les liquéfier et les boire en smoothie."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al carecer de dientes, segrega una mucosidad que disuelve a sus presas para facilitar su posterior ingestión."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon’s mucous can dissolve anything. Toothless, it sprays mucous on its prey. Once they’re nicely dissolved, it slurps them up."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"歯が ないので なんでも 溶かす 粘液を 獲物に かけて 溶かしてから すすって 喰らう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il se déplace en rampant lentement. Ses organes et son cerveau se trouvent dans sa protubérance dorsale en forme de spirale."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon se arrastra con lentitud. La protuberancia en espiral de su espalda contiene tanto el cerebro como los órganos internos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It crawls along sluggishly. The swirly protrusion on its back is filled with its brain and other organs."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"のそのそ 這って 移動する。 渦状の 突起は 脳みそや 内臓が 詰まっている 部分。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’un mucus capable de faire fondre n’importe quoi. Pensez à mettre des gants adaptés si vous voulez le toucher !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su cuerpo está recubierto por una mucosidad que puede disolver cualquier material, así que es mejor usar guantes especiales para tocarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its entire body is covered with gooey mucus that can dissolve anything. Be sure to put gloves on if you’re going to touch it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"全身が 何でも ドロドロに 溶かす 粘液で 包まれている。 触るときは 手袋を しよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Étant donné sa faiblesse, c’est uniquement grâce à son fluide pouvant tout dissoudre qu’il a échappé à une extinction quasi certaine."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Segrega una mucosidad que corroe todo lo que toca. Esto le ha permitido protegerse y evitar la extinción a pesar de su debilidad intrínseca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Although this Pokémon isn’t very strong, its body is coated in a caustic slime that can melt through anything, so predators steer clear of it."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"なんでも 溶かしてしまう 粘液で 保護されているため 弱くても 捕食されず 生き残ってきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son petit cerveau est caché dans la bosse qui est sur son dos. Il ne pense pas à grand-chose, si ce n’est à se nourrir et à fuir devant ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"La protuberancia del lomo contiene su pequeño cerebro, que solo piensa en buscar comida y huir de los enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The lump on its back contains its tiny brain. It thinks only of food and escaping its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"背中の 突起の 中に 小さな 脳みそが ある。 エサと 敵から 逃げることしか 考えていない。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui's water."}],"varieties":[{"id":705,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[15,"level-up",32],[16,"level-up",32],[17,"level-up",32],[18,"level-up",32],[20,"level-up",49],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",49],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bide","learns":[[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"bubble","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18